==English==

===Etymology===
Borrowed from {{bor|en|la|pariēs||wall of a house or room}}. Compare {{cog|fr|paroi||wall}}, {{cog|it|parete||wall}}, {{cog|pt|parede||wall}} and {{cog|es|pared||wall}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|parietes}}

# The [[wall]] of any [[cavity]] in the body.
# {{lb|en|zoology}} The triangular middle part of each segment of the shell of a barnacle.

